{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>口感超絲滑!推薦淋上香濃黑醋拌吃</p><p>中環新開話題意式小酒館</p><p>由備受歡迎的灣仔意式小酒館Trattoria Felino創辦人打造的IL PRESIDENTE，於中環都爹利街開幕，是一間氣氛滿溢的意大利餐廳及酒吧。主打多款意大利經典小食、主菜及網上爆紅的席邊即伴意大利雪糕，一開幕就成話題餐廳。</p><p>焦點席邊即伴意大利雪糕！</p><p>席邊即伴意大利雪糕是意大利近年高檔意式餐廳的奢華儀式感甜品，在IL PRESIDENTE都能夠享用得到。侍應或甜品師會推著精緻的復古餐車直接來到餐桌旁，在顧客面前現場呈獻雪糕的製作與擺盤過程。與一般事先舀好儲存的雪糕不同，侍應現場以軟化技術攪拌，品嚐最佳享用的溫度與柔軟度；而顧客亦可以自由選擇配料，倒如黑醋、特級初榨橄欖油、海鹽碎、堅果脆粒等。將Gelato 昇華為極具戲劇效果的餐末表演！</p><p>各式意大利小食+主菜</p><p>各款意大利小食推介有：招牌菜松露蛋（Egg Tartufato）、橄欖油浸坎塔布連海鯷魚、和牛生牛肉薄片、自家製米蘭燉牛膝雲吞等，主菜亮點是米蘭炸小牛扒，裏上麵包糠的小牛扒夾入芳堤娜芝士與煙燻火腿炸至金黃。</p><p>IL PRESIDENTE 地址：中環都爹利街13號M2號舖； 可由都爹利街石階直達 電話： 5443 0908 (只限WhatsApp) 營業時間：星期一 6pm – 11pm，星期三至星期日 6pm – 11pm 官方IG：@ilpresidentehk</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178867441654328668_20609803926a9d0170e0292.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178867441820773783_18538149046a9d0172b84fe.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178867442022159029_12848130316a9d01748de61.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178867442249417840_14374513026a9d017709a77.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178867442463730319_10268600016a9d01795d353.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178867442728914792_11034522006a9d017beaca3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178867442921711910_19359453066a9d017d959fa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178867443092729715_7091791546a9d017f7dcae.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178867443291996767_9096934586a9d018144bff.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T06:18:19.047459+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":677,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}